Template: @PKG@/setup_mode
Type: select
Choices: wizard, skip
Default: wizard
Description: 配置方式 / Configuration mode:
 wizard: 使用安装向导 / guided setup
 skip: 保留现有配置；无配置时使用默认配置并手动启动
       keep the existing config, or use defaults without autostart

Template: @PKG@/node_name
Type: string
Default: NexusNet
Description: 节点名称 / Node name:

Template: @PKG@/node_description
Type: string
Default: NexusNet P2P node
Description: 节点描述 / Node description:

Template: @PKG@/port
Type: string
Default: 5000
Description: WebSocket TCP 端口 / WebSocket TCP port:

Template: @PKG@/bootstrap
Type: string
Description: bootstrap 节点 / Bootstrap nodes:
 向导中每行一个或逗号分隔；preseed 使用逗号分隔。
 必须包含 /ws 和 /p2p/<PeerId>，例如
 /ip4/1.2.3.4/tcp/5000/ws/p2p/12D3KooW...
 One per line or comma-separated in the wizard; comma-separated in preseed.
 /ws and /p2p/<PeerId> are required.

Template: @PKG@/local_services_enabled
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: 是否启用本地服务 / Enable local services:

Template: @PKG@/local_services
Type: string
Description: 本地服务 / Local services:
 逗号分隔，格式 name:port 或 name:port:auth，例如 ocr:5014
 Comma-separated name:port[:auth].

Template: @PKG@/auth_enabled
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: 是否启用鉴权网络 / Enable authentication network:

Template: @PKG@/pq_transport
Type: boolean
Default: true
Description: PQ 传输由安装器固定启用 / PQ transport is forced on:

Template: @PKG@/pq_identity
Type: boolean
Default: true
Description: PQ 身份由安装器固定启用 / PQ identity is forced on:

Template: @PKG@/pq_required
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: 要求对端必须支持 PQ / Require PQ peers:

Template: @PKG@/auth_network
Type: string
Default: none
Description: 鉴权网络 / Authentication network:
 填 none 表示关闭；向导只支持一个网络 / none disables auth; one network only.

Template: @PKG@/auth_authority
Type: string
Description: 鉴权网络 Authority 公钥 / Authority public key:
 base64 Ed25519 公钥；auth_network 为 none 时留空 / base64 Ed25519 key, empty when auth is none.

Template: @PKG@/allow_bootstrap
Type: boolean
Default: true
Description: 允许作为 bootstrap / Allow bootstrap role:

Template: @PKG@/accept_bootstrap_providers
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: 接受 Identify 发现的 bootstrap provider / Accept bootstrap providers:

