Template: @PKG@/skip_note
Type: note
Description: 已跳过 NexusNet 配置向导 / NexusNet setup skipped
 默认配置已生成，服务未启动。编辑 /etc/@PKG@/config.toml 后执行：
 systemctl enable --now @PKG@
 Default config was generated and the service was not started.

Template: @PKG@/legacy_note
Type: note
Description: NexusNet 配置需要更新 / NexusNet config needs attention
 ${ERROR}
 服务已停止并禁用。请运行 dpkg-reconfigure @PKG@ 或手动修改 /etc/@PKG@/config.toml。
 The service has been stopped and disabled.
